      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.6,
      "end_seconds": 5.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Hmm, morning, doctor. Lovely to to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.35,
      "end_seconds": 11.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Of course, leave it it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.82,
      "end_seconds": 19.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "I've been losing things. Uh, I've also had impatience, for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.04,
      "end_seconds": 21.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.42,
      "end_seconds": 29.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Oh, and difficulty concentrating. That's been about the same, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.47,
      "end_seconds": 34.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.63,
      "end_seconds": 39.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Erm, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.43,
      "end_seconds": 56.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "did you get low mood, thoughts of self-harm, drug use or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.63,
      "end_seconds": 66.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "I, I haven't had low mood, thoughts of self-harm, drug use or head injury, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.11,
      "end_seconds": 70.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.42,
      "end_seconds": 75.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "ah, no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.0,
      "end_seconds": 79.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.34,
      "end_seconds": 82.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.5,
      "end_seconds": 87.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.79,
      "end_seconds": 90.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "I've got anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.26,
      "end_seconds": 100.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "yes yes, anxiety is known to us, good to have that clear alright, have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.09,
      "end_seconds": 111.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "hmm, you know, I had part of my thyroid removed years back i've been putting this off for weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.31,
      "end_seconds": 117.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.89,
      "end_seconds": 125.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.59,
      "end_seconds": 128.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "is that that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.18,
      "end_seconds": 132.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "For about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.6,
      "end_seconds": 136.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.37,
      "end_seconds": 142.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.41,
      "end_seconds": 145.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Right, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.66,
      "end_seconds": 150.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.15,
      "end_seconds": 157.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Right, what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.82,
      "end_seconds": 161.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.66,
      "end_seconds": 176.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.69,
      "end_seconds": 180.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.12,
      "end_seconds": 195.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.23,
      "end_seconds": 210.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "that's it, just a a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.93,
      "end_seconds": 238.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 124 over 72, saturation 97 percent, pulse is 66 beats a a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.24,
      "end_seconds": 244.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.74,
      "end_seconds": 248.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.86,
      "end_seconds": 267.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal and your examination is unremarkable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.84,
      "end_seconds": 284.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with possible adult attention deficit disorder at this stage. Another possibility is anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.18,
      "end_seconds": 289.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I mean, is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.7,
      "end_seconds": 303.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.97,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible adult attention deficit disorder do well once it's treated properly. I'm going to order a thyroid test, for poor concentration."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.25,
      "end_seconds": 306.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.57,
      "end_seconds": 312.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a questionnaire for attention problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.2,
      "end_seconds": 319.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do I need to to prepare?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.0,
      "end_seconds": 330.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "use lists and reminders while we arrange the specialist assessment i'd like to see you again after the assessment have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.14,
      "end_seconds": 338.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
